er","composer","film actor","songwriter","television actor"],"debut":"1998","agencies":[],"groups":[],"links":{"instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/happymong79/","x":"https://x.com/monkeyfunch","spotify":"https://open.spotify.com/artist/6gEWl778wJTkq4Uk5eBvgD","musicbrainz":"https://musicbrainz.org/artist/d26412ee-ab95-4ca3-844d-fe88583d6235"},"photo":null,"bio":{"text":"Shin Dong-hyun, better known by his stage name MC Mong, is a South Korean hip hop recording artist, record producer, radio personality, actor and television personality who is known for his comic disposition and his upbeat songs. He is one of the most commercially successful hip hop artists in Korea. He gained popularity in the early 2000s as an actor on the sitcom, Nonstop, before releasing his debut album, 180 Degree, in 2004. He was also a cast member of the variety show, 2 Days & 1 Night from 2007 to 2010. He was charged in 2010 with draft dodging, after which he was banned from appearing on major Korean broadcast networks.","title":"MC Mong","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/MC_Mong"}},"Q489952":{"id":"Q489952","name":"Eugene","ko":"유진","birthName":"","birthNameEn":"","aliases":["Kim Yoo-jin","Kim Yoojin","Kim Yoo Jin","Kim Yu-jin","Kim Yujin","Kim Yu Jin"],"birth":"1981-03-03","death":"","birthplace":"Seoul","nationality":["South Korea"],"height":null,"occupations":["actor","singer","pianist"],"debut":"1997","agencies":[{"name":"SM Entertainment","korean":true,"id":"Q483938","start":"","end":""}],"groups":[{"id":"Q491542","name":"S.E.S.","start":"1997","end":"2002"}],"links":{"instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/eugene810303/","x":"https://x.com/islandgirl_81","musicbrainz":"https://musicbrainz.org/artist/5962d824-6409-4874-8a74-adcd14a15657"},"photo":null,"bio":{"text":"Kim Yoo-jin, known anglicizedly and mononymously as Eugene, is a South Korean actress and singer. She is a former member of the girl group S.E.S., which went on to become one of South Korea's best-selling artists. Following the group's disbandment in 2002, she subsequently left SM Entertainment and released two solo studio albums. As an actress, Eugene has participated in various television dramas and movies, making her acting debut in KBS2 Loving You (2002). Her other notable roles include in Save the Last Dance for Me (2004), Wonderful Life (2005), Bread, Love and Dreams (2010), A Hundred Year Legacy (2013), All About My Mom (2015) and The Penthouse: War in Life (2020–2021).","title":"Eugene (actress)","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Eugene_%28actress%29"}},"Q491360":{"id":"Q491360","name":"Bae Seul-ki","ko":"배슬기","birthName":"","birthNameEn":"","aliases":["Bae Seul Ki","Bae Seulki","Bae Seul-gi","Bae Seulgi","Bae Seul Gi","Seul-ki Bae","Seulki Bae","Seul Ki Bae"],"birth":"1986-09-27","death":"","birthplace":"South Korea","nationality":["South Korea"],"height":null,"occupations":["actor","singer","film actor"],"debut":"2005","agencies":[],"groups":[],"links":{"instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/bebe_sl/","x":"https://x.com/oBSBSo","youtube":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCTQnttlQA6s-mATjo1loLKQ","musicbrainz":"https://musicbrainz.org/artist/466b4cef-9f59-41a8-b0cc-ebb8fefcd5ed"},"photo":{"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/38/Bae_Seul-ki_from_acrofan.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Bae_Seul-ki_from_acrofan.jpg","author":"acrofan.com","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0"},"bio":{"text":"Bae Seul-ki is a South Korean singer and actress. She made her entertainment debut as a member of The Red, but has since become a solo singer.","title":"Bae Seul-ki","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bae_Seul-ki"}},"Q494816":{"id":"Q494816","name":"Cho Kyuhyun","ko":"규현","birthName":"조규현","birthNameEn":"","aliases":["Kyuhyun","Cho Kyu-hyun"],"birth":"1988-02-03","death":"","birthplace":"Seoul","nationality":["South Korea"],"height":null,"occupations":["singer","actor","